he ways that if you didn't have all  that experience it's like skiing I've  said reading a book on skiing doesn't  teach you how to ski yeah you got to go  and you got a ski and get lots of miles  under your skis and incidentally if you  don't fall you're not skiing hard enough  and you're not learning anything so if  your career has ups and downs I got  fired didn't turn out so bad but you  know you can start a little business and  maybe it doesn't work and after a while  you got to be smart to say hey I tried  it don't let you go getting away I can't  keep doing this I've got to earn a  living but you know a year from now I'm  gonna come up with a better idea and  then I'll go back and do it again  if you want to know how you should start  your day tomorrow check out the video  right there next to me I think you'll  enjoy it continue to believe and I'll  see you there  you should never feel comfortable you  should be happy and dissatisfied too  many of you are sitting around waiting  to feel ready
 

